  "knowledge": {
    "progressSummary": "Created AmgmInequalityOQ02OQ01OQ02.lean: 6 theorems, 0 sorries, 0 axioms. Proves off-diagonal symmetry via Prod.swap bijection and Finset.sum_image.",
    "builtItems": [
      "offDiag_eq_upper_union_lower: offDiag = {i<j} ∪ {j<i}",
      "upper_lower_disjoint: upper and lower triangular parts disjoint",
      "image_swap_lower_eq_upper: swap maps {j<i} → {i<j} exactly",
      "sum_lower_eq_sum_upper: Σ_{j<i} f = Σ_{i<j} f for symmetric f",
      "sum_offDiag_eq_two_mul_sum_upper: Σ_{i≠j} f = 2·Σ_{i<j} f",
      "offDiag_prod_eq_two_mul_e2: specialization to products xᵢxⱼ"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "Prod.swap provides the explicit bijection between lower and upper triangular parts",
      "Finset.sum_image cleanly handles the reindexing step",
      "The proof works over any CommRing, not just ℝ"
    ],
